SHARED_OBJECT_BELL_FAMILYJR_2016
Platform: Linux Embedded Arris
Year: 2016
Compatibility: Arris VIP1113 and compatible boxes
Runtime: Linux embedded, USB install
Purpose: Legacy Family Jr On Demand archive for 2016
Backend: Emby-compatible media server

This placeholder .so file marks the 2016 archive build for the Bell On Demand Family Jr collection.
It is intended to exist as the shared object bundle used by the embedded Arris box runtime.
